# PoC working state — regenerated by `node tests/poc/run-poc.mjs`.
.work/
# Isolated-Cell working state — regenerated by `node tests/poc/run-cell.mjs`.
# Kept separate so the two runners cannot delete each other's evidence.
.work-cell/
# The isolated locked-DSH install is materialized on demand:
#   cd tests/poc/.dsh-install && pnpm install
# `pnpm-lock.yaml` IS committed (it pins the full transitive set of the locked
# runtime, which is the point of a locked DSH version); only node_modules is not.
.dsh-install/node_modules/
